        396,
        1237,
        1186,
        1295
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 9. The Office of Management and Budget and the Municipal Services Administration shall coordinate with the New York Telephone Company the implementation of equipment expenditure reductions.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
